# Data & models (self-generated, not source)
data/
artifacts/*
!artifacts/.gitkeep
# ...except the three the dashboard's Research view reads. They are the
# evidence README.md and docs/RESULTS.md already quote, so committing them
# discloses nothing new and keeps the repo self-consistent: a fresh clone
# renders the measured results instead of an empty state. Regenerate with
# `make ablation`, `make train`, `make screen`. The sweeps and the trained
# model stay out -- they are large and re-derivable.
!artifacts/ablation_multiseed.json
!artifacts/deeplob_metrics.json
!artifacts/venue_screen.md
models/*.pt
models/*.onnx
models/*.pth
!models/.gitkeep

